            </a>
            <div class="dropdown">
              <a href="/wind/guide" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">📖</span><span><span class="di-title">Guide Overview</span><span class="di-desc">Start your learning journey</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/symptoms" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">🔍</span><span><span class="di-title">Symptom Library</span><span class="di-desc">Every symptom explained</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/energy" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">🔋</span><span><span class="di-title">Energy & Fatigue</span><span class="di-desc">Why it happens, what helps</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/muscle" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">💪</span><span><span class="di-title">Muscle & Strength</span><span class="di-desc">Preventing and reversing loss</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/mood" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">😔</span><span><span class="di-title">Mood & Mind</span><span class="di-desc">Irritability, focus, motivation</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/sleep" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">🌙</span><span><span class="di-title">Sleep</span><span class="di-desc">Why testosterone and sleep link</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/sexual-health" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">❤️</span><span><span class="di-title">Sexual Health</span><span class="di-desc">Libido and erectile changes</span></span></a>
              <a href="/wind/guide/talk-to-doctor" class="dropdown-item"><span class="di-icon">🩺</span><span><span class="di-title">Talk to Your Doctor</span><span class="di-desc">How to prepare</span></span></a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/wind/quiz" class:list={[{ active: isActive('/wind/quiz') }]}>Symptom Check</a></li>
          <li><a href="/wind/blog" class:list={[{ active: isActive('/wind/blog') }]}>Journal</a></li>
          <li class="mob-menu-cta">
            <a href="/wind/quiz" class="btn btn-primary mob-menu-cta-btn">Take the Symptom Check</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="navbar-right">
          <a href="/" class="all-programs-link">All programs ↗</a>
          <a href="/wind/quiz" class="btn btn-primary navbar-cta">Symptom Check</a>
          <button class="mobile-toggle" id="mobile-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">
            <svg id="icon-menu" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
            <svg id="icon-close" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" style="display:none"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
      <slot />
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="container footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-about">
          <div class="footer-brand">His Midlife</div>
          <p class="footer-tagline">The strength doesn't have to fade quietly.</p>
          <p class="footer-sub-tagline">Andropause and midlife vitality support for Indian men. Information and support, not medical advice.</p>
          <div class="footer-disclaimer">
            This service provides general health information only. It is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult your doctor or a qualified healthcare professional.
          </div>
          <p class="footer-programs-link"><a href="/">Explore our other programs →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Explore</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/wind">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/quiz">Symptom Check</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/blog">Journal</a></li>
            <li><a href="/">All Programs</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Guide</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide">Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/symptoms">Symptom Library</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/energy">Energy & Fatigue</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/muscle">Muscle & Strength</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/mood">Mood & Mind</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/sleep">Sleep</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/sexual-health">Sexual Health</a></li>
            <li><a href="/wind/guide/talk-to-doctor">Talk to Your Doctor</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Talk to Us</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://wa.me/919266032660" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Us</a></li>
            <li><a href="mailto:thesecondspringofficial@gmail.com">thesecondspringofficial@gmail.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
